        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: All We Ever Knew, Signs of Light\n- People: The Head and the Heart, Charity Rose Thielen, Chris Zasche, Kenny Hensley, Tyler Williams\n- Companies: Warner Bros.\n\nFacts:\n- The Head and the Heart wrote and recorded the song \"All We Ever Knew.\"\n- \"All We Ever Knew\" was released as the lead single from The Head and the Heart's third studio album \"Signs of Light.\"\n- Warner Bros. released The Head and the Heart's album \"Signs of Light.\"\n- The Head and the Heart is an American folk band.\n- Charity Rose Thielen is a member of The Head and the Heart and performs violin, guitar, and vocals.\n- Chris Zasche is a member of The Head and the Heart and plays bass.\n- Kenny Hensley is a member of The Head and the Heart and plays piano.\n- Tyler Williams is a member of The Head and the Heart and plays drums.",
